  "bodyHash": "0DpRaBCngo0=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MIqTqet.png\" width=\"542\" height=\"194\"><br><br></strong><strong><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fKingybu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4fnAZgM.png\" width=\"331\" height=\"34\"></a><br></strong></strong><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\">厭倦了 Minecraft 的基礎使用者介面了嗎？</strong></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/hM7UhuRFaa\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lvIL7aA.png\" width=\"185\" height=\"37\"></a></strong></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/kingybu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cqteEYQ.png\" width=\"202\" height=\"39\"></a></strong></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.instagram.com%252fkingybusiness%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2b2cGRW.png\" width=\"187\" height=\"30\"></a></strong></p><p><strong>厭倦了每次靠近附魔台，卻只看到和合成工作台一樣的灰色選單嗎？想要為你的遊戲增添一些色彩嗎？隆重介紹「彩色容器」，現在支援深色模式！</strong></p><p><strong>這是一個容器 GUI 取代模組，希望能讓每個選單都符合 Minecraft 中色彩繽紛的可互動方塊。<br>撇開這些花招不談，這個材質包會取代每個方塊的 GUI，例如合成工作台和熔爐。每個新選單都會從其關聯的方塊中汲取靈感。有些甚至還有動畫！<br></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/optigui\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QhUZf5G.png\" width=\"413\" height=\"30\"></a><br></strong>或 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Optifine</a><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/572we2z.png\"><br></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 合成工作台&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 終界箱&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;鐵砧 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CZBBaAo.png\"></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><strong>請仔細閱讀！</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>如果你<strong>使用 OptiGUI 或 Optifine</strong>，請使用任何「模組版」語言以預防錯誤<br><br>如果你<strong>沒有使用 OptiGUI 或 Optifine&nbsp;</strong>，請使用「原版」語言以正確顯示箱子和其他材質！<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VffXUn6.png\"></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/syZkvjR.png\" width=\"72\" height=\"27\"><br>- 配方書<br>- 鐵砧<br>- 高爐<br>- 釀造台<br>- 製圖台<br>- 合成器&nbsp;<br>- 箱子（大型、小型、終界箱）<strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KpcLE4g.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"27\"></strong><br>- 合成工作台<br>- 發射器<br>- 投擲器<strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KpcLE4g.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"27\"></strong><br>- 附魔台<br>- 熔爐<br>- 砂輪<br>- 漏斗<br>- 紡織機<br>- 界伏盒（所有顏色）<strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KpcLE4g.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"27\"></strong><br>- 煙燻爐<br>- 切石機<br>- 鍛造台<br>- 木桶<br>- 村民職業<strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KpcLE4g.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"27\"></strong><br>- 烽火台&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>包含項目</strong><br>- 深色載入畫面 <strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MD7GkQB.png\" width=\"82\" height=\"15\"></strong><br>- 深色進度選單<br>-<span style=\"text-align:center\">生存模式物品欄&nbsp;<br></span></p><p><span style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RtheOPo.png\" width=\"64\" height=\"31\"></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">為什麼有些材質無法運作？</span><br></strong>請確定你已安裝 <strong>Optifine</strong> 或 <strong>OptiGUI 和 Animatica</strong>。某些材質，例如 Minecart 和 Chest Boat 的 GUI，由於 Optifine 的限制，只能與 OptiGUI 搭配使用。<br>我始終建議使用 <strong>OptiGUI</strong> 和 <strong>Animatica</strong> 來取代 Optifine！<br><br><strong>-<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">我可以將你的材質包加入我的模組包嗎？</span><br>可以</strong>，你可以將我的任何資源包加入你的 Modrinth 或 Curseforge 模組包中，<strong>前提是</strong>你必須給予我適當的 credits，並將我的材質包設為相依項目。<strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">我可以去哪裡提交關於模組支援或其他事物的建議？</span><br></strong>你可以在<strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/hM7UhuRFaa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></strong> 上提交建議！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>-<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">有些東西無法正常運作，或者我有問題。</span><br></strong>你可以去尋求幫助，沒錯，你猜對了！就是<strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/hM7UhuRFaa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></strong>！</span></p>\n</div><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iabKPjs.png\" width=\"323\" height=\"33\"><br>- 儲物箱筏 <strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PLg8xaL.png\" width=\"67\" height=\"14\"></strong><br>- 儲物箱船 <strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PLg8xaL.png\" width=\"67\" height=\"14\"></strong></p><p><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Vu4XFTD.png\" width=\"261\" height=\"36\"><br></strong></strong><span style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-align:center\">- 創造模式物品欄</span></span><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><br></strong></strong><span style=\"text-align:center\">- 模組支援</span></p><p><strong><strong style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dUMzdKH.png\" width=\"113\" height=\"26\"><br></strong></strong><strong>Chris_XENO<br></strong><strong>BurntToast_<br></strong><strong>Kingybu</strong></p><p><em>特別感謝：</em><strong><em><br></em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/optigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shrimpsnail</a><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fBeagleNF4O4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BeagleNF404</a><br>我的支持者們 :)</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oklbCS0.png\" width=\"116\" height=\"32\"><br>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540demonjoetv%252fvideo%252f7344793939091803434\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5upkBgn.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"215\"></a><br>&nbsp;@<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540demonjoetv%252fvideo%252f7344793939091803434\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">demonjoetv</a><br></strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><a style=\"color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540shockbyte%252fvideo%252f7379275001075125505\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zL9qMJv.png\" width=\"122\" height=\"216\"></a><br>&nbsp;@<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540shockbyte%252fvideo%252f7379275001075125505\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">shockbyte</a></p>\n</div><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/816/941/more-by-me.png\" alt=\"more by me.png\" width=\"466\" height=\"48\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/colourful-containers-gui\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/816/939/pack2.png\" alt=\"pack2.png\" width=\"98\" height=\"98\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/brewing-guide\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/816/938/pack1.png\" alt=\"pack1.png\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></strong></a><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/kingybus-hud-plus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/816/940/pack4.png\" alt=\"pack4.png\" width=\"113\" height=\"113\"></a><br></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fkingybu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/1ae62cc0-f2ab-4597-88a2-f1c45b3b49ae.webp\" width=\"754\" height=\"125\"></strong></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
